@direction LR
@spacing 60

(1 - Lawmatics: Website, Phone or Referral Lead You Mark Ready to Engage) -> [2 - Lawmatics: Pull the Full Intake Questionnaire]
[2 - Lawmatics: Pull the Full Intake Questionnaire] -> [3 - Clio: Create the Client Contact]
[3 - Clio: Create the Client Contact] -> [4 - Clio: Open the Estate Planning Matter]
[4 - Clio: Open the Estate Planning Matter] -> [[5 - Google Sheet: Add the Client to Your Intake Sheet]]
[[5 - Google Sheet: Add the Client to Your Intake Sheet]] -> [6 - Google Docs: Fill In Their Engagement Letter]
[6 - Google Docs: Fill In Their Engagement Letter] -> [7 - Gmail: Send the Welcome Email and Engagement Letter]
[7 - Gmail: Send the Welcome Email and Engagement Letter] -> [8 - Claude Fills Your Will, Trust and POA Templates]
[8 - Claude Fills Your Will, Trust and POA Templates] -> [9 - Google Docs: Save the First Drafts in the Client Folder]
[9 - Google Docs: Save the First Drafts in the Client Folder] -> [10 - Clio: Task Your Paralegal to Review the Drafts]
(11 - Every Weekday Morning) -> [12 - Clio: Pull Every Open Matter and Its Stage]
[12 - Clio: Pull Every Open Matter and Its Stage] -> [13 - Pick Clients Quiet on Signing, Documents or Retainer]
[13 - Pick Clients Quiet on Signing, Documents or Retainer] -> [14 - Gmail: Remind the Client, Copy Your Paralegal]
(15 - New Email in Your Gmail Inbox) -> [16 - Claude Reads It and Writes a Short Summary]
[16 - Claude Reads It and Writes a Short Summary] -> {17 - Can Your Paralegal Handle It?}
{17 - Can Your Paralegal Handle It?} -> "true" -> [18 - Gmail: Route It to Your Paralegal With the Summary]
(19 - Any Step Fails) -> [20 - Gmail: Alert Your Paralegal, Not You]
[Claude - Reads the Questionnaire] --> [8 - Claude Fills Your Will, Trust and POA Templates]
[Returns Fill-Ins and Open Questions] --> [8 - Claude Fills Your Will, Trust and POA Templates]
[Claude - Sorts Your Mail] --> [16 - Claude Reads It and Writes a Short Summary]
[Returns Route and Summary] --> [16 - Claude Reads It and Writes a Short Summary]
